node_modules/
.sma/

# The built window. A release builds it from spa/; the repository never carries it.
daemon/static/app/

# Its neighbours for the length of one build: the scratch directory a build writes into
# before it is swapped into place, the displaced copy that swap holds for two renames, and
# the previous window a landing keeps aside until the branch's verdict is in. All three are
# derived, all three are transient, and none of them belongs in a diff.
daemon/static/.app-*/

.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Raw vitest JSON, consumed by `pnpm badge` to stamp test-receipt.json. The
# RECEIPT is committed; the transient report it was derived from is not.
.vitest-report.json

# Run reports the live-UI driver writes beside the tree it drove — screenshots and
# a verdict per run. They belong to whoever drove the run, never to the published
# history: a single `git add -A` would otherwise carry a working session's internal
# material into a repository the world reads. Ignored rather than trusted to
# discipline, because the cost of the mistake is a rewritten history.
.planning/
